{"id": "unknown-2026-10-22-039", "date": "2026-10-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 43, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Engie starts building first co-located solar and battery project in France", "content": "<p>Engie has begun construction of its first co-located solar and battery project in France, combining 29.8 MW of solar capacity with a 20 MWh battery system to shift electricity delivery to periods of higher grid demand.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/22/engie-starts-building-first-co-located-solar-and-battery-project-in-france/\">Engie starts building first co-located solar and battery project in France</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/22/engie-starts-building-first-co-located-solar-and-battery-project-in-france/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-22-040", "date": "2026-10-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 43, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase", "improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Solar-assisted CO₂ heat pump achieves 18.7% COP increase as irradiance rises", "content": "<p>Researchers in Italy have tested a 10 kW dual-source heat pump using CO₂ as a refrigerant and air or photovoltaic-thermal collectors as heat sources. The results show that solar operation can improve heating performance under favorable irradiance conditions, while an optimized source-switching strategy delivers modest annual electricity savings.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/22/solar-assisted-co%e2%82%82-heat-pump-achieves-18-7-cop-increase-as-irradiance-rises/\"", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/22/solar-assisted-co%e2%82%82-heat-pump-achieves-18-7-cop-increase-as-irradiance-rises/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-22-041", "date": "2026-10-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 43, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Spanish region announce tax on ground mounted PV", "content": "<p>The Spanish region of Castilla y León plans to extend its environmental impact tax to ground-mounted solar installations from 2027. Spanish solar association UNEF has criticised the proposal, arguing that PV projects already face multiple taxes and that the new levy lacks environmental justification.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/22/spanish-region-announce-tax-on-ground-mounted-pv/\">Spanish region announce tax on ground mounted PV</a> appeared first on <a href=\"", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/22/spanish-region-announce-tax-on-ground-mounted-pv/", "type": "rss"}]}
